# The scheduler's minute.
#
# Paired with myfiesta-scheduler.timer. Laravel decides which commands are due;
# this only has to run every minute, which is the standard arrangement and the
# one the schedule in routes/console.php is written against.
#
# What stops working without it: abandoned baskets keep holding stock, webhook
# deliveries stop being retried, scheduled campaigns never send, reminders
# never go out, repeating events stop appearing on new dates, and data exports
# sit on disk past the week they are allowed.

[Unit]
Description=myFiesta scheduled commands
After=network.target

[Service]
Type=oneshot
User=www-data
Group=www-data
WorkingDirectory=/var/www/myfiesta/apps/api
ExecStart=/usr/bin/php artisan schedule:run
